# LedgerWatch — root ignore (belt-and-suspenders; server/ and client/ each have their own)
# Never commit secrets or dependencies.
**/node_modules/
**/.env
.env
**/dist/
dist/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env.local
build/
resume-session.txt
*resume-session.txt

# Wallet seed phrases / private keys - NEVER commit.
# These were tracked and pushed to origin (commits 1820f35, d68cfd5) before this
# rule existed. Untracking does NOT remove them from history: treat any phrase in
# here as compromised and rotate it. See docs/SECURITY.md section 6 for the purge.
acccountSecretPhrase/
*.seed
*.mnemonic
*secret*phrase*
keystore*.json

# One-off audit and probe scripts. These make live network calls the moment they
# are required, depend on packages the project does not declare, and are excluded
# from lint — so they are throwaway working notes, not part of the product. They
# were tracked at the package roots, where `node _audit_svc.js` from the wrong
# directory hits mainnet. Kept locally under scratch-audits/, untracked.
scratch-audits/
_audit_*.mjs
_audit_*.js

# Internal engineering docs - local only, never published.
# The repo is public; the defect register, architecture and build plan are not
# for a public audience. Purged from history 2026-08-28. README.md is the only
# markdown this project publishes.
*.md
!README.md
.[c]laude/
/docs/
/[c]laude-project/
/design-handoff/

# Phone screenshots shared for debugging; local only.
/screenshots/
